       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TOMIC-EXTENDED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TOMIC-EXTENDED-PROOFS.
           05  WS-LEXICAL-TRANSFORMATION-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SYSTEMATIC-SUBJECTIVIZE-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NON-AGENTIVE-CASE-ROLES  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RECURSIVE-PHRASE-MARKER  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GENERATIVE-GAP-CONDUIT   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TOMIC-EXT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-TOMIC-EXT-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-TOMIC-EXT-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LEXICAL-AND-SUBJECTIVIZE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CASES-AND-PHRASE-MARKERS.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-GENERATIVE-CONDUIT.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-TOMIC-EXT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LEXICAL-AND-SUBJECTIVIZE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LEXICAL-TRANSFORMATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SYSTEMATIC-SUBJECTIVIZE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CASES-AND-PHRASE-MARKERS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NON-AGENTIVE-CASE-ROLES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RECURSIVE-PHRASE-MARKER.
       3000-EVALUATE-GENERATIVE-CONDUIT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GENERATIVE-GAP-CONDUIT.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-TOMIC-EXT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-LEXICAL-TRANSFORMATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SYSTEMATIC-SUBJECTIVIZE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NON-AGENTIVE-CASE-ROLES = 1 AND
              WS-RECURSIVE-PHRASE-MARKER = 1 AND
              WS-GENERATIVE-GAP-CONDUIT = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-TOMIC-EXT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-TOMIC-EXT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-TOMIC-EXT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-TOMIC-EXT-CODE.
